    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_1",
      "text": "天气对运动有很大的影响。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3360,
      "durationMs": 3360,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_2",
      "text": "夏天的时候，天气很热。",
      "startMs": 3360,
      "endMs": 5760,
      "durationMs": 2400,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_3",
      "text": "如果在外面跑步，身体可能会不舒服。",
      "startMs": 5760,
      "endMs": 10040,
      "durationMs": 4280,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_4",
      "text": "你可以选择早上或者晚上去运动，也可以去游泳。",
      "startMs": 10040,
      "endMs": 16800,
      "durationMs": 6760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_5",
      "text": "冬天的时候，天气很冷，很多人不想出门。",
      "startMs": 16800,
      "endMs": 21760,
      "durationMs": 4960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_6",
      "text": "其实，在家里也可以做运动。",
      "startMs": 21760,
      "endMs": 25080,
      "durationMs": 3320,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_7",
      "text": "你可以在网上找一些简单的运动，跟着做。",
      "startMs": 25080,
      "endMs": 29760,
      "durationMs": 4680,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_8",
      "text": "不管天气怎么样，只要你想运动，就一定能找到办法。",
      "startMs": 29760,
      "endMs": 36400,
      "durationMs": 6640,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p7_sp7_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp7_9",
      "text": "所以，不要因为天气不好，就不运动。",
